package semantic

// The default rules and exclusions. Each rule is derived from the data
// object name, its CDC and the data object description of the IEC
// 61850-7-4, 7-420 or TR 61850-90-3 NSD and standard text; nothing is
// inferred from name fragments at run time. Where the standard leaves
// the unit or the meaning open, the data object is excluded with the
// reason instead of guessed. Rules on an abstract class (HarmonicsLN,
// SupervisionLN, SwitchingEquipmentLN, ...) apply to every class that
// inherits it.

